[2025-07-30 12:15:00] BUGFIX: View Compatibility Error Fix

## Issue
Error: "Undefined array key 'total_batches'" in pembelian-pakan.blade.php line 88

## Root Cause
View still expected old data structure with 'total_batches' key, but new structure uses 'total_purchases'

## Fix Applied

### 1. Controller Data Transformation
Updated exportFeedPurchaseToHtml() method to map new data structure to view expectations:
```php
'summary' => [
    'total_batches' => $data['summary']['total_purchases'], // Map total_purchases to total_batches
    'total_purchases' => $data['summary']['total_items'], // Map total_items to total_purchases
    'total_quantity' => $data['summary']['total_quantity'],
    'total_value' => $data['summary']['total_value'],
    // ... other fields
]
```

### 2. View Data Access Update
Updated view to use new relationship structure:
```php
// Before
{{ $batch->feedPurchases->count() }}
{{ $batch->feedPurchases->sum(function($purchase) { ... }) }}

// After  
{{ $batch->feedPurchaseItems->count() }}
{{ $batch->feedPurchaseItems->sum(function($item) { ... }) }}
```

## Files Modified
- app/Http/Controllers/PurchaseReportsController.php (exportFeedPurchaseToHtml method)
- resources/views/pages/reports/pembelian-pakan.blade.php (data access patterns)

## Testing Status
- [x] Error fixed
- [x] View compatibility maintained
- [x] Data mapping correct
- [x] Summary calculations working

## Notes
- Maintained backward compatibility for existing views
- Data transformation ensures smooth migration
- All summary cards now display correct values

